    "detailed_description": "<h1>Notice!</h1><p>This game is not fully finished and tested yet, lacking contents and having bugs</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The main content of this game:\r\n.Building scenes and structures\r\n.Creating character and animations\r\n.Character and scenes interaction\r\n\r\nThis game has:\r\n.Customizable world with unlimited size\r\n.Character with customizable appearance and animation\r\n.Physic-based movement and destruction\r\n.Ray-tracing-baed global illumination\r\n\r\nThis game has not (yet):\r\n.Original characters\r\n.Storys and missions\r\n.Levels and challenges\r\n.Collections and achievements\r\n\r\nThis game lacks (yet):\r\n.Music and sound effects\r\n.Art",
